; Comma as decimal mark, with P price lines for the same commodity.
; hledger reads 3,50 EUR as 3.50 -- a P line says nothing about number style.
decimal-mark ,

commodity 1.000,00 EUR

P 2024-01-01 EUR $1,10
P 2024-02-01 EUR $1,12

